---
permalink: "/stays/"
eleventyComputed:
  pageTitle: "Vacation Rental Stay Collections"
  pageDescription: "Browse Seascape stay collections by destination, trip type, and amenities across Anna Maria Island, Bradenton, Sarasota, and Florida's Gulf Coast."
---
{% set destinationSections = [
  {
    "key": "anna-maria-island",
    "title": "Anna Maria Island",
    "intro": "Use these pages when the trip is centered on AMI access, island feel, and near-island pool-home tradeoffs."
  },
  {
    "key": "bradenton",
    "title": "Bradenton",
    "intro": "Best for guests who want bigger houses, waterfront options, docks, and faster value than the island usually gives."
  },
  {
    "key": "sarasota",
    "title": "Sarasota",
    "intro": "Useful when the trip skews toward culture, restaurants, downtown access, or a polished city-side base."
  },
  {
    "key": "siesta-key",
    "title": "Siesta Key",
    "intro": "The narrower Siesta Key lane. Keep this section tight because the inventory and fit are tighter."
  }
] %}
{% set pageUpdatedLabel = gitLastModifiedLabel(page.inputPath) %}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{ pageTitle }} | Seascape Vacations</title>
  <meta name="description" content="{{ pageDescription }}">
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
  <link rel="canonical" href="{{ site.url }}/stays/">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:url" content="{{ site.url }}/stays/">
  <meta property="og:title" content="{{ pageTitle }} | Seascape Vacations">
  <meta property="og:description" content="{{ pageDescription }}">
  <meta property="og:image" content="{{ site.url }}/images/seascape-og-default.jpg">
  <meta property="og:locale" content="en_US">
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="{{ site.name }}">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="{{ pageTitle }} | Seascape Vacations">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="{{ pageDescription }}">
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="{{ site.url }}/images/seascape-og-default.jpg">

  {% include "partials/organization-schema.njk" %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "{{ site.url }}/"},
      {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Stay Collections", "item": "{{ site.url }}/stays/"}
    ]
  }
  </script>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "CollectionPage",
    "name": "{{ pageTitle }}",
    "description": "{{ pageDescription }}",
    "url": "{{ site.url }}/stays/"
  }
  </script>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" media="print" onload='this.media="all"'>
  <noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"></noscript>
  <style>
    :root {
      --brand: #5F8A8B;
      --brand-dark: #3D5C5D;
      --brand-darker: #22393A;
      --gold: #C9A962;
      --cream: #F5EED6;
      --cream-light: #FAF7EE;
      --stone: #3A3A3A;
      --stone-light: #6A6A6A;
      --white: #FFFFFF;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: Poppins, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(232, 213, 163, 0.28), transparent 32%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #fbf7ef 0%, #f4ecdb 100%);
      color: var(--stone);
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    h1, h2, h3 {
      font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    .skip-link {
      position: absolute;
      top: 8px;
      left: 8px;
      transform: translateY(-200%);
      background: var(--brand-darker);
      color: white;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      z-index: 100;
      transition: transform .2s ease;
    }

    .skip-link:focus { transform: translateY(0); }

    .nav-inner,
    .hero,
    .section,
    .footer-inner {
      max-width: 1240px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding-left: 24px;
      padding-right: 24px;
    }

    {% include "partials/site-header-styles.njk" %}

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 44px;
      padding: 0 22px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand) 0%, var(--brand-dark) 100%);
      color: white;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(61, 92, 93, 0.18);
    }

    .hero {
      padding-top: 112px;
      padding-bottom: 24px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 32px;
      align-items: end;
    }

    .hero-tag,
    .section-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--brand-dark);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 68px);
      line-height: 0.98;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      max-width: 760px;
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      max-width: 720px;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: var(--stone-light);
    }

    .hero-note,
    .category-card,
    .utility-card {
      border-radius: 26px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero-note {
      padding: 24px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .hero-note strong,
    .card-kicker {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--brand);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .hero-note p,
    .section-note,
    .category-intro,
    .utility-copy {
      color: var(--stone-light);
    }

    .hero-note p { margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .hero-note small { font-size: 13px; color: var(--stone-light); }

    .section {
      padding-top: 28px;
      padding-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .section-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .section-head h2 {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);
      color: var(--brand-darker);
    }

    .category-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .category-card-body,
    .utility-card-body {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .category-card h3,
    .utility-card h3 {
      font-size: 26px;
      color: var(--brand-dark);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .category-links,
    .utility-links {
      list-style: none;
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .category-links a,
    .utility-links a {
      color: var(--brand-darker);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .category-links a:hover,
    .utility-links a:hover {
      color: var(--brand);
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .utility-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .utility-pills {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .utility-pills a {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 38px;
      padding: 0 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--cream-light);
      border: 1px solid rgba(95, 138, 139, 0.14);
      color: var(--brand-dark);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .cta-section {
      padding-top: 12px;
      padding-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .cta-panel {
      max-width: 1240px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 24px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand-dark) 0%, var(--brand-darker) 100%);
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .cta-panel h2 {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 38px);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .cta-panel p {
      max-width: 640px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
    }

    .cta-panel .btn {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E3C47A 0%, var(--gold) 38%, #8E6D28 100%);
      color: #2A2014;
      box-shadow: none;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 28px;
      background: var(--brand-darker);
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
    }

    .footer-inner {
      padding-top: 34px;
      padding-bottom: 34px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .footer a { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); }

    a:focus-visible,
    button:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--gold);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .hero,
      .category-grid,
      .utility-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .cta-panel {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

  {% set navButtonHref = "/properties/" %}
  {% set navButtonLabel = "Browse Homes" %}
  {% include "partials/site-header.njk" %}

  <main id="main">
    <header class="hero">
      <div>
        <p class="hero-tag">Stay Collections</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title">Use the live stay pages as a real collection hub, not a dead prefix</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">These pages route by destination, trip shape, and amenity fit across Anna Maria Island, Bradenton, Sarasota, and the wider Gulf Coast. Use them to narrow the right house before you open individual property pages.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="hero-note">
        <strong>How to use this page</strong>
        <p>If you already know the market, start with the destination sections. If the trip shape matters more than the map, use the amenity and use-case links below.</p>
        <p>This is the parent hub for the live `/stays/&lt;slug&gt;/` pages, so the collection pages can finally point to each other cleanly.</p>
        <small>Updated {{ pageUpdatedLabel }}</small>
      </aside>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="section-tag">Browse by Destination</p>
          <h2>Destination collections</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-note">These are the fastest routes when the guest already knows the geography and needs the best-fit landing page for that market.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="category-grid">
        {% for section in destinationSections %}
        <article class="category-card">
          <div class="category-card-body">
            <span class="card-kicker">Destination</span>
            <h3>{{ section.title }}</h3>
            <p class="category-intro">{{ section.intro }}</p>
            <ul class="category-links">
              {% for page in staysPages %}
              {% set isIndexableStay = seoGovernance.staysNoindexSlugs.indexOf(page.slug) === -1 %}
              {% if isIndexableStay and page.destination == section.key %}
              <li><a href="/stays/{{ page.slug }}/">{{ page.title }}</a></li>
              {% endif %}
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="section-tag">Trip Type & Amenities</p>
          <h2>Use-case collections</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-note">These pages cut across destinations. Use them when the booking is really about pool setups, dock access, group size, pet rules, or extended-stay shape.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="utility-grid">
        <article class="utility-card">
          <div class="utility-card-body">
            <span class="card-kicker">Cross-market filters</span>
            <h3>Trip shape and amenity pages</h3>
            <p class="utility-copy">This is the catchment for pages that span multiple markets or answer a specific stay question better than a destination page does.</p>
            <ul class="utility-pills">
              {% for page in staysPages %}
              {% set isIndexableStay = seoGovernance.staysNoindexSlugs.indexOf(page.slug) === -1 %}
              {% if isIndexableStay and (not page.destination or page.destination == "florida-gulf-coast") %}
              <li><a href="/stays/{{ page.slug }}/">{{ page.title }}</a></li>
              {% endif %}
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="utility-card">
          <div class="utility-card-body">
            <span class="card-kicker">Next step</span>
            <h3>When to leave the hub</h3>
            <p class="utility-copy">Use a stay collection page to choose the right lane, then jump into the direct-book catalog when you are ready to compare actual homes and dates.</p>
            <ul class="utility-links">
              <li><a href="/properties/">Open the full direct-book property collection</a></li>
              <li><a href="/guides/where-to-stay-near-anna-maria-island/">Read the where-to-stay guide first</a></li>
              <li><a href="/guides/booking-direct-vacation-rentals/">See why booking direct changes the total trip cost</a></li>
              <li><a href="/guides/anna-maria-island-vs-siesta-key/">Compare AMI and Siesta Key before you lock the wrong market</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section">
      <div class="cta-panel">
        <div>
          <h2>Need the actual homes, not just the collection logic?</h2>
          <p>Once the trip shape is clear, open the direct-book property catalog and compare the current Seascape inventory in one place.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="btn" href="/properties/">Browse Direct-Book Homes</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div>© 2026 {{ site.name }}</div>
      <div><a href="/">Home</a> · <a href="/guides/">Guides</a> · <a href="/properties/">Properties</a> · <a href="/property-management/">Property Owners</a></div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  {% include "partials/site-header-script.njk" %}
  {% include "partials/analytics-ga4.njk" %}
</body>
</html>
